<section id="faq" style="padding:clamp(70px,8vw,130px) clamp(20px,4vw,40px);background:#FAFAF9;border-top:1px solid #ECEDEE">
<div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto">
<div data-reveal style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91">09 — Questions</div>
<h2 data-reveal style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,54px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:500">Frequently asked.</h2>
<p data-reveal style="margin:20px 0 0;max-width:560px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#55565A">Everything people want to know before the first box. Anything we have missed, message us.</p>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px 44px;border-top:1px solid #E6E7E9;padding-top:26px;margin-top:40px;align-items:start"><div data-reveal style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px"><span>Product &amp; usage</span><span style="color:#B9BABD">04</span></div><div data-reveal style="grid-column:span 2;min-width:280px;border-top:1px solid #E6E7E9"><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">What exactly is a Dr.Strips+ strip?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">A thin film that dissolves on your tongue in under a minute. Strip2Cell delivery carries the actives through the mucosal tissue in your mouth and into your bloodstream, rather than routing them through your gut and liver. No water, no capsule, nothing to swallow.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">When and how do I take it?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Ten minutes before bedtime. One strip on your tongue, let it dissolve, no water. Avoid eating or drinking for a couple of minutes afterwards. One strip a night.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">Will I wake up groggy?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">That heaviness usually comes from an overdose of synthetic melatonin still in your system past sunrise. This formula is calibrated to a plant-derived signal and clears with your own rhythm.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">Is it habit-forming?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">No. There is no dependency mechanism and no need to escalate the dose. Night thirty behaves like night three.</p></details></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px 44px;border-top:1px solid #E6E7E9;padding-top:26px;margin-top:40px;align-items:start"><div data-reveal style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px"><span>The formula</span><span style="color:#B9BABD">04</span></div><div data-reveal style="grid-column:span 2;min-width:280px;border-top:1px solid #E6E7E9"><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">Why pistachio instead of melatonin?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Pistachio extract is one of the richest natural sources of phytomelatonin — the plant-derived form of the same signal your body already reads, delivered with its natural cofactors instead of isolated in a lab.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">What does it taste like?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Mixed berry, sweetened with monk fruit and steviol glycosides. Zero sugar, and it is gone in under a minute.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">Can I take it alongside other supplements or medication?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">It is a health supplement for generally healthy adults, not a medicine. If you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication or managing a condition, speak to your doctor before use. Keep out of reach of children.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">Can I see the lab report for my box?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Yes. Every batch is third-party tested for potency and purity. Quote the batch number printed on your box and we will send the certificate of analysis for that batch.</p></details></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px 44px;border-top:1px solid #E6E7E9;padding-top:26px;margin-top:40px;align-items:start"><div data-reveal style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px"><span>Shipping &amp; delivery</span><span style="color:#B9BABD">03</span></div><div data-reveal style="grid-column:span 2;min-width:280px;border-top:1px solid #E6E7E9"><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">What does shipping cost?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Free on one-time orders above S$100, and free on every subscription. Below that, standard Singapore delivery is charged at checkout.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">How quickly does it arrive?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Orders placed before the daily cut-off leave the same or next working day and usually land within one to three working days.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">Do you ship outside Singapore?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Not yet. Singapore only for now.</p></details></div></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px 44px;border-top:1px solid #E6E7E9;padding-top:26px;margin-top:40px;align-items:start"><div data-reveal style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A8C91;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px"><span>Guarantee &amp; orders</span><span style="color:#B9BABD">04</span></div><div data-reveal style="grid-column:span 2;min-width:280px;border-top:1px solid #E6E7E9"><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">How does the 30-night guarantee work?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Take it for thirty nights — the full box. If nothing changes, email us and we refund it. No return, no forms, no questions.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">Can I pause or cancel a subscription?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Any time, from your account. No notice period and no fee.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">My box arrived damaged or wrong.<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">Send us your order number and a photo within seven days of delivery and we will replace it or refund it at no cost to you.</p></details><details data-faq style="border-bottom:1px solid #E6E7E9"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 2px;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:450;letter-spacing:-.02em">How is my personal data handled?<span data-faq-mark style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:16px;color:#8A8C91">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0 2px 22px;max-width:640px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#55565A">We follow Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act. You can ask us to access, correct or delete your data at any time.</p></details></div></div>
<p data-reveal style="margin:40px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#8A8C91;max-width:680px">Health supplements in Singapore are sold without a licence but must comply with HSA guidelines, which we follow. Not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.</p>
</div></section>

